# Installation

=== "pip"

    ``` console
    pip install {{package_name}}
    ```

=== "uv"

    ``` console
    uv add {{package_name}}
    ```

Requires **{{python_versions[0]}}+**. Works on all major platforms including {{supported_operating_systems | join(', ')}}.
